  "description": "NETWUH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C146 H156 Eu4 N12 O22,2(C2 H3 N1),2(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.602-3.978 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.76-111.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu4(μ3-OH)2L6(tmhd)4]·CH3CN·CH3CH2OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
